{"3093500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ExoFrontier: Venus", "steam_appid": 3093500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ExoFrontier: Venus is an Action RPG with procedurally generated dungeons. You will never have to do the same level again and again, all upgrades are permanant, become stronger thanks to the RPG elements and the evolution of the colony, and follow the story of Doug as you go deeper inside the dungeons!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/b00d87fae29981cc29071a18f860c384.poster.avif?t=1785776889\" width=1014 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/b00d87fae29981cc29071a18f860c384.webm?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/b00d87fae29981cc29071a18f860c384.mp4?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hostile Environment:</strong> Explore a mysterious planet and unearth ancient artifacts to unlock the secrets of Venus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Base Improvements:</strong> Improve Lumina, your home base by accomplishing quests and meet new folks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Procedurally Generated: </strong> Discover new maps configuration each time you enter in a dungeon </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/dc9d1e9d5c8ecaeb34ad55500f44884e.poster.avif?t=1785776889\" width=1014 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/dc9d1e9d5c8ecaeb34ad55500f44884e.webm?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/dc9d1e9d5c8ecaeb34ad55500f44884e.mp4?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 22XX, Earth is overpopulated and the planet Venus has become habitable. Doug, our protagonist, decides to go there and becomes an <strong>explorer</strong>. He'll be entrusted with dangerous missions in various little-explored parts of the planet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/66f4e80df403453295784806fe39c34c.poster.avif?t=1785776889\" width=1014 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/66f4e80df403453295784806fe39c34c.webm?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/66f4e80df403453295784806fe39c34c.mp4?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore dangerous dungeons of the planet Venus with your explorer equipments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can move, jump, fly with a jetpack, roll, backdash and attack with both a melee and a ranged weapon.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face various enemies and find the exit of each level to go deeper into the dungeons.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can improve Lumina, the main city, in order to attract more people in Venus, and obtain better equipments </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/5ec94b297be43d66f5d76d6e0309f9b7.poster.avif?t=1785776889\" width=1014 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/5ec94b297be43d66f5d76d6e0309f9b7.webm?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/5ec94b297be43d66f5d76d6e0309f9b7.mp4?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Micro-levels procedurally generated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 zones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hundreds of items and gadgets to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strong RPG elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Permanent upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/925cb0a65a2b3e705836040e789e0265.poster.avif?t=1785776889\" width=1014 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/925cb0a65a2b3e705836040e789e0265.webm?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093500/extras/925cb0a65a2b3e705836040e789e0265.mp4?t=1785776889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ExoFrontier: Venus is an Action RPG with procedurally generated dungeons. You will never have to do the same 